extFontFamily":"Inter","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"BvuiC-C3fXnVMvtP4NEZ7"},{"id":"CGlkeeVsqu7RFTzrOJt6-","fillColor":"#607d8b","height":120,"position":{"x":10300,"y":5070},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":140,"text":"","textFontFamily":"Inter","stickyNote":true,"attachedFrame":"BvuiC-C3fXnVMvtP4NEZ7"},{"id":"2Fi0lfLUzlGyHKvbraw5Z","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10720,"y":4770},"width":1720,"height":120,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Facilitation guide","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"tL4RwGWE8c7sGkjfrnwIA","textSize":56,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"2Nd_DOWZgPEcmdJlHtf3W","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10740,"y":4940},"width":1680,"height":1060,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"🚀 Retrospective: How it works in 5 steps\n\n🎯 Purpose: Look back on a sprint, project or event and agree on improvements.\n\n1. Set the stage (5 min)\nAction: Name the period you are looking back on and agree to be open and respectful.\n\n2. Collect (10 min, silent)\nAction: Everyone writes cards for the quadrants:\nCONTINUE – what worked well and should stay?\nSTOP – what holds us back?\nINVENT – what new idea would we try with unlimited resources?\nRule: One point per card, use the matching colour stack.\n\n3. Present and cluster (15 min)\nAction: Each person briefly reads out their cards. Group similar cards.\n\n4. Prioritise (5 min)\nAction: Dot voting (e.g. 3 dots each) on the most important topics.\n\n5. Act (15 min)\nAction: For the top topics, define concrete steps in ACT: what, who, by when.\nGoal: 1–3 actions that are actually done before the next retro.\n\n🛠️ Your role as facilitator\nSafe space: Make sure nobody is blamed.\nTimekeeper: Protect enough time for the ACT quadrant.\nFollow-up: Start the next retro by checking last time's actions.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"tL4RwGWE8c7sGkjfrnwIA","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"N0pgPX9BMu5mlg7s95UXE","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4770},"width":1920,"height":120,"fillColor":"#ff5722","text":"METADATEN · T05 · wird vor Veröffentlichung entfernt","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PCoChvnrTOLbX9KoO12vy","textSize":44,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"Keroh6x3iVx2HIs3XNjNW","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4910},"width":1920,"height":130,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"Template-ID: T05   ·   Datei: T05_retro-continue-stop-invent-act.en.nwb   ·   Board-Format: v2 (Infinite Canvas)\nQuelle: Schnellstart_Paket.nwb (= Schnellstart_Templates.nwb) › Rahmen 4\nAusfüllen: In „Ihr Eintrag\" eigenen Text schreiben oder ✓ setzen, um den Vorschlag zu übernehmen. Leer = noch offen.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PCoChvnrTOLbX9KoO12vy","textSize":22,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"3oc1-4XlpKebPbI_wTD-h","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5060},"width":430,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Feld","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PCoChvnrTOLbX9KoO12vy","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"RmkumeYyi6cBxbIWjCpJ0","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13090,"y":5060},"width":690,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Vorschlag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PCoChvnrTOLbX9KoO12vy","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"IeiNOgSDkitnUBY1oDo-E","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13800,"y":5060},"width":760,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Ihr Eintrag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"PCoChvnrTOLbX9KoO12vy","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"RgFCdmKobr__4qj7haz55","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5128},"width":430,"height":93,"fillColor":"#d7dee2","text":"Veröffentlichen?\n[publish]